# Docs & workflow

Chi tiết: `.cursor/docs/WORKFLOW.md` · verify: Human Play → `/checklist-done`.  
Pipeline: `multi-model-pipeline.mdc` · skill `game-dev-pipeline` (Claude → Composer → Codex Review → Human; Debug khi Human báo).

## Trước khi code tính năng

1. Phase **Plan (Claude)** — spec `.cursor/docs/features/Fxxx-*.md` hoặc `/new-feature`
2. Đọc `.cursor/docs/03-ARCHITECTURE.md`, `.cursor/docs/01-MODULES.md`, `.cursor/docs/CONTEXT.md`
3. **Không implement** nếu còn `[TBD]` / thiếu acceptance — Build sau handoff Composer

## Sau khi implement (Composer / Build)

- Sync `01-MODULES`, `02-SCENES`, `04-CHANGELOG`; spec giữ `in-progress`
- Handoff **Review (Codex)** — soi code; rồi Human Play (Agent **không** tự chạy thử game)

## Phân công Editor vs Agent

| Agent | Human |
|-------|-------|
| `assets/scripts/**/*.ts` | Scene, prefab, node tree |
| Docs spec/module/architecture | Wire `@property`, collider, sprite |
| Review code; debug khi Human báo bug | Play mode + `/checklist-done` |

Hướng dẫn Editor: `.cursor/docs/guides/`.

## Tra cứu nhanh

| Cần biết | File |
|----------|------|
| Game design | `.cursor/docs/00-GDD.md` |
| Module & script | `.cursor/docs/01-MODULES.md` |
